.page umask 1 show or set the file creation mask

# SYNOPSIS
*umask* [_MODE_]

# DESCRIPTION
`umask` is a gapsh builtin. With an octal _MODE_ it sets the file creation mask: the permission bits in the mask are removed from newly created files. Without one it prints the current mask.

# EXAMPLES
    umask 077
    umask

# SEE ALSO
chmod(1), stat(1)
